		(at 116.85 117.9)
		(descr "Dual land pattern for ESP32-C5-WROOM-1U (primary, U.FL) or ESP32-C5-WROOM-1 (fallback, PCB antenna). Pads 1-32 = Espressif WROOM-1U land pattern (datasheet v1.3 Fig 11-2); WROOM-1 pads 1-29 coincide (pad 14/15 edge shared). Origin = Espressif WROOM-1U footprint origin. Rule area = WROOM-1 antenna area + 1 mm margin, notched around pads 30-32.")
