					(thickness 0.15)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "Description" "ESP-Hosted SPI co-processor. Either module fits the dual footprint: ESP32-C5-WROOM-1U-N8R8 (primary, U.FL connector for the Taoglas FXP831.07.0100C) or ESP32-C5-WROOM-1-N8R8 (fallback, PCB antenna, see MPN_ALT; its antenna area stays copper-free). Pads 30-32 (GND, ANT2 NC, GND) exist on the 1U only. Pad 19 is PSRAM CS on N8R8, leave NC (DS v1.3 Tables 3-1/3-2). Firmware: CLK=GPIO6, MOSI=GPIO7, MISO=GPIO2, CS=GPIO10, HANDSHAKE=GPIO1, DATA_READY=GPIO0; set every pin in menuconfig (DESIGN_NOTES.md §6)."
			(at 0.25 -0.65 0)
