		(property "Description" "Host-rail supervisor driving U3 PR1 (replaces the R11 / R12 divider). VDD = +3V3_HOST, push-pull active-low RESET to PR1: PR1 high (host selected) once VIN1 rises above VIT+ 2.93-3.07V (3.00V typ), low (USB) below VIT- 2.857-2.944V (2.90V typ); VIT- +-1.5%, VHYS 75-125mV (TI SNVSB03E 6.5). Output defined low from VPOR 0.3V. MR and CT open (tSTRT 220us typ). C10 100nF bypass at VDD. DESIGN_NOTES.md section 2."
			(at 0 0 270)
			(layer "F.Fab")
			(hide yes)
