		(property "Description" "Board-to-board link to ControlBoard2027 J9, on this board's underside. Samtec Razor Beam LSHM, 0.5mm, 20 pins, shielded, hermaphroditic: same part on both boards, 5mm mated stack. Pin p here mates controlboard pin p-1 (even) or p+1 (odd). The radio sits over the controlboard MCU, held by J2 and two M2 standoffs (H1/H2)."
